        // and block.number > guesses[caller].block, we can craft a situation where
        // block.number is not > storedBlock immediately; but we can warp forward one block
        // and then call settle; if storedBlock == block.number + 1 (as correct contract),
        // then after advancing one block settle will revert because block.number is not > storedBlock.
