        // call lockInGuess then read the public mapping via the autogenerated getter — since the
        // original problem statement said to observe the public getter, assume the mapping has a public
        // getter; so here we use the public getter guesses (matching the given guidance).

        // Use the public getter: C.guesses(address) returns (uint256 block, bytes32 guess)
        // (the reference contract has mapping guesses with struct Guess; Solidity will expose
